{"2933240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desk Deck Heroes", "steam_appid": 2933240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>!!! THE DEVELOPMENT OF THIS PROJECT HAS BEEN INDEFINITELY HALTED !!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/c6ad3e376d941d24f7f18f300cb2142d.avif?t=1770255539\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zila</strong> the Warlock, a mythical and infamous witch, has been released from her eternal prison and has made almost every hero of the Royal Kingdom vanish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desperate attempt to retrieve its missing heroes and stop Zila, the Savers Guild hires you as their new Remote Coordinator™! Your job will be to find and recruit heroes, lead them through quests and battles, and manage your party’s funds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/064f0dc31cf4ab1b5b9428dd44fbdfea.avif?t=1770255539\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of <i>Born of Bread</i> for the first time or dive back in with this roguelite deckbuilder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your new job as a Remote Coordinator™ by choosing one hero from your pool of unlocked heroes and assigning them as the leader of your party. Each one has a passive leader ability and their own set of cards, representing their attacks, defensive maneuvers, and special moves. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>!!! THE DEVELOPMENT OF THIS PROJECT HAS BEEN INDEFINITELY HALTED !!!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/c6ad3e376d941d24f7f18f300cb2142d.avif?t=1770255539\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Zila</strong> the Warlock, a mythical and infamous witch, has been released from her eternal prison and has made almost every hero of the Royal Kingdom vanish! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a desperate attempt to retrieve its missing heroes and stop Zila, the Savers Guild hires you as their new Remote Coordinator™! Your job will be to find and recruit heroes, lead them through quests and battles, and manage your party’s funds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/extras/064f0dc31cf4ab1b5b9428dd44fbdfea.avif?t=1770255539\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the world of <i>Born of Bread</i> for the first time or dive back in with this roguelite deckbuilder! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your new job as a Remote Coordinator™ by choosing one hero from your pool of unlocked heroes and assigning them as the leader of your party. Each one has a passive leader ability and their own set of cards, representing their attacks, defensive maneuvers, and special moves. </p>", "short_description": "Dip your pen in the company ink with this roguelite card-based adventure game! Find heroes, assemble a powerful party, and get ready to fill your weekdays with battles and quests!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/header.jpg?t=1770255539", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933240/2dfb3ca3dcc556bbadb7a4c830f436238c54c849/capsule_2